      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just the overrides may not work well cross avatar since things like props or particles are game objects inside unity and would have to be copied to the other avatar. What if that other avatar has a different bone naming scheme? What if it has bigger hands or smaller? The only 100% universal animations would be humanoid bone movement (so only hand gestures and dances(without sound))\n\nI would like to have the option to upload multiple custom overrides for one avatar though, so that i can have more different animations on one avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
