  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-21T02:26:31.588Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I had a crazy idea. Since all the avatars that are uploaded to VRChat have the same bone structure, why not make sharable custom override animations as a pedestal attachment for avatars to use. Imagine any avatar choosing from a variety of custom animation overrides instead of an override being solely part of one avatar. It could be a great feature to look for while browsing for avatars. An example could be if a Kanna were to encounter a custom animation override from a Knuckles and be able to use their animations. I think this could be a fun new addition to VRChat. Anyhoo, that's my crazy or perhaps dumb idea. Just thought I'd throw the idea out there.",
